## Introduction & Setup

### What is Laravel?
Laravel is a PHP web framework designed for building web applications with an expressive, elegant syntax. It follows the MVC (Model-View-Controller) pattern and emphasizes developer experience.

### Key Features
- Elegant syntax & rapid development
- Built-in authentication & authorization
- Database abstraction via Eloquent ORM
- Blade templating engine
- Job queues & event system
- Broadcasting for real-time updates
- Comprehensive testing tools

### Installation

```bash
# Using Composer
composer create-project laravel/laravel project-name

# Or using Laravel Installer
laravel new project-name

# Start development server
php artisan serve
```

