## Models & Eloquent ORM

### Creating Models
```bash
# Basic model
php artisan make:model Post

# Model with migration
php artisan make:model Post -m

# Model with migration and factory
php artisan make:model Post -mf

# Model with seeder
php artisan make:model Post -s
```

### Model Basics
```php
<?php

namespace App\Models;

use Illuminate\Database\Eloquent\Model;
use Illuminate\Database\Eloquent\Factories\HasFactory;

class Post extends Model
{
    use HasFactory;

    // Table name (optional if follows convention)
    protected $table = 'posts';

    // Primary key (optional if 'id')
    protected $primaryKey = 'id';

    // Fillable attributes
    protected $fillable = ['title', 'body', 'author_id'];

    // Or use guarded (opposite of fillable)
    protected $guarded = ['id'];

    // Hidden attributes
    protected $hidden = ['password'];

    // Cast attributes
    protected $casts = [
        'published_at' => 'datetime',
        'is_active' => 'boolean',
        'metadata' => 'array',
    ];

    // Timestamps
    public $timestamps = true; // Default
}
```

### Query Builder Basics
```php
// Get all records
$posts = Post::all();

// Get first record
$post = Post::first();

// Get by ID
$post = Post::find(1);
$post = Post::findOrFail(1); // Throws ModelNotFoundException

// Where clause
$posts = Post::where('status', 'published')->get();

// Multiple conditions
$posts = Post::where('status', 'published')
    ->where('author_id', 1)
    ->get();

// Where with operators
$posts = Post::where('views', '>', 100)->get();
$posts = Post::where('title', 'like', '%Laravel%')->get();

// WhereIn
$posts = Post::whereIn('status', ['published', 'draft'])->get();

// WhereNull
$posts = Post::whereNull('deleted_at')->get();

// Count
$count = Post::count();
$count = Post::where('status', 'published')->count();

// First or Last
$post = Post::where('status', 'published')->first();
$post = Post::where('status', 'published')->latest()->first();

// Order By
$posts = Post::orderBy('created_at', 'desc')->get();
$posts = Post::latest('created_at')->get();

// Limit & Offset
$posts = Post::limit(10)->offset(0)->get();
$posts = Post::skip(10)->take(10)->get();

// Pagination
$posts = Post::paginate(15); // Returns PaginationInterface
$posts = Post::simplePaginate(15);
```

### Creating & Updating Records
```php
// Create
$post = Post::create([
