```

### Before & After Middleware
```php
// Before (before request processed)
class BeforeMiddleware
{
    public function handle(Request $request, Closure $next)
    {
        // Do something before
        return $next($request);
    }
}

// After (after response generated)
class AfterMiddleware
{
    public function handle(Request $request, Closure $next)
    {
        $response = $next($request);
        // Do something after
        return $response;
    }
}
```

